Here are the next two documents. PROMPTS.md is the highest-leverage file in the entire project — the product's actual quality lives here. UI_SPEC.md locks down layout and interaction so the build doesn't invent UI on the fly.

Two decisions confirmed in these documents (per ARCHITECTURE.md §15): the honesty rule is immutable and app-appended (never editable, never toggleable), and strict mode is always on (no user-facing switch). This is the safer, simpler, more on-brand choice for a business whose entire reputation rests on not inventing places that don't exist.

